# Live CodeWarrior project area on the AFP-mounted tree (G4). Contains
# the live .µ project files, per-target settings (.stg/.tdt), build
# products (.xSYM, PEF artifacts), Apple/Metrowerks sample files
# (CompositeClassDriver.r, HelloWorld.c — not ours to publish), and
# source copies that duplicate classic/. The canonical sources live in
# classic/ and probe/.
USBMIDI9/

# Python bytecode (tools/re smoke tests)
__pycache__/

# Preserved RD2 MacsBug session transcripts. They are referenced by name +
# sha256 in docs/freemidi-driver-abi.md but contain raw dumps of proprietary
# binaries, so they stay untracked on purpose — never commit or redistribute.
RD2-SESSION.TXT
RD2-SESSION2.TXT
